{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Armor & Helmets|Armored $Striders}}

Good boot armor that offers protection and [[Agility]]. 

==How to Acquire==

First you need to wield a [[smithy's hammer]] in one hand. Then right click an [[anvil]].

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{\frac{_{q}Metal+ _{q}Leather}{2} *  9 + {_{q}Anvil* 4 + _{q}Smithy's Hammer}* 3}{16}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Strength *Smithing}</math>.

==Stat Formulas==

{| class="wikitable" style="text-align: center"
!Stat
!Formula
